{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/124ed21f938237374c5fb89032f6335f.poster.avif?t=1759197641\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/124ed21f938237374c5fb89032f6335f.webm?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/124ed21f938237374c5fb89032f6335f.mp4?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of Auto Afterlife comes <strong><i>Alter Evo</i></strong>, a narrative driven psychological horror game. Play as Evo, a jobless loner in the decaying, futuristic city of North Terrace. Your therapist sets you up on a date with Brunilda, and it's not long before you find out that her life is in danger. You are the only person who can help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.poster.avif?t=1759197641\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.webm?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/9cfe8858c7de34183148f19018ba31b5.mp4?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern third person shooter combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the Negative Agents, a horde of cybernetic creatures terrorizing the citizens of North Terrace. Their origin remains a mystery - but some speculate they have a connection to an alien race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.poster.avif?t=1759197641\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.webm?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/141168402f76abc18fdc3ab0325be86a.mp4?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the relationship drama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your therapist introduces you to Brunilda, a brilliant but haunted artist. That same day, Amelia Jalisco enters your life under strange circumstances. Between them begins a quiet battle for Evo\u2019s heart \u2014 one that pulls you into a world of obsession and secrecy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.poster.avif?t=1759197641\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.webm?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/08eebf4c0c7b71d3fbb5354ec75d9263.mp4?t=1759197641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a dying city.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-open world design allows you to drive between buildings and areas of the city. Use speed tunnels to fast track it across the world if you want avoid the THUGs and Kill-Mobiles roaming the streets.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Details:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System -\u00a0</strong>Collect Upgrade Nodes to enhance your weapons at Upgrade Benches found throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Puzzles </strong>\u2013 An additional layer of hidden puzzles will lead you to secret areas, narrative clues, and disturbing memories. Like a scavenger hunt, these puzzles can span the entire game world, and often require a deep level of attention to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1759197641","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1759197641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759197641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759197641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2379320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/229364